REM flipper_notepad_test.ducky
REM Benign Flipper Zero BadUSB (DuckyScript) — opens Notepad and types a message
REM Usage: save as .ducky, copy to /BadUSB/ on Flipper SD, test only on devices you own.

DELAY 2000
GUI r
DELAY 200
STRING notepad.exe
ENTER
DELAY 500
STRING Hello from Flipper Zero! This is a harmless test message.
ENTER
